*MOT:	come on . 
%mor:	verb|come-Fin-Imp-S adp|on .
%gra:	1|2|ROOT 2|1|ADVMOD 3|1|PUNCT
%wor:	come  on  .
@Comment:	note: first mealtime (and shorter) of two on the tape. Chi's activities in school and plans for the upcoming Thanksgiving celebration are the principal focus of this mealtime conversation. Mot persists in having one of the two children (both are in the study) have the tape be her mealtime , so there's a performance bias here... Mot tries to quiz Chi about the Thanksgiving story but Chi's a bit confused and thinks a mouse was in charge rather than Christopher Columbus. I guess they saw <The Mouse on the Mayflower> in school.
@Comment:	Time is 0:04
