@Comment:	this is the second mealtime on the tape. Thanksgiving now looms ahead even closer , and Chi has brought home her first report card of the year. Tune in for more adventures of the www family. Mot doesn't seem to have adjusted much to Chi's age level; she still quizzes on the days of the week and asks Chi what she is eating (for the benefit of the tape). On the other hand , though she's very verbal and chatty , Chi doesn't perform well even on these questions. Not certain Fat is really Fat but he doesn't say anything anyway
